{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game demo combines classic RPG progression with Roguelike survivors. Upgrade, collect gems to improve your attributes, and become stronger to meet the ever-increasing challenges. The demo version includes some equipment crafting,  secret realms, and content will be launched in the official version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipment production system, can produce various sets of equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626900/extras/\u88c5\u5907\u56fe.jpg?t=1744292860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rune strengthening system, you can permanently increase combat power by strengthening runesThere are big bosses and elite monsters in each level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626900/extras/\u7b26\u6587\u56fe.jpg?t=1744292860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are big bosses and elite monsters in each level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626900/extras/\u81ea\u7206\u602a.gif?t=1744292860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can be crafted through forging<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626900/extras/\u953b\u9020.png?t=1744292860\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can obtain resources through lottery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626900/extras/\u62bd\u5956\u56fe.jpg?t=1744292860\" />24 maps of different difficulty levels, the challenge is more difficult<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626900/extras/\u5730\u56fe\u56fe.jpg?t=1744292860\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground